---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import EnquiryForm from '../components/EnquiryForm.astro';
export const prerender=true;
---
<Layout title="Dealer enquiries"><section class="page-head"><div class="wrap"><div class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Dealer enquiries</span></div><p class="eyebrow">DEALER ENQUIRIES</p><h1>Discuss a local sales opportunity.</h1><p>Tell us about your business, service area, facilities, sales experience and trailer market.</p></div></section><div class="wrap prose"><h2>Information to include</h2><ul><li>Registered business name and primary contact</li><li>Proposed sales area and existing customer base</li><li>Premises, display capacity and collection access</li><li>Relevant vehicle, equipment or trailer experience</li><li>Sales, service and customer-support capability</li></ul><p>A dealer enquiry starts a review. It does not grant a territory, appointment or right to represent CAR TRAILERS AUSTRALIA.</p><a class="button" href="#enquiry">Send a dealer enquiry →</a></div><section class="section wrap form-layout" id="enquiry"><EnquiryForm topic="dealer"/><aside><p class="eyebrow">YOUR NEXT STEP</p><h2>Keep the details together.</h2><p>Include the trailer, requirements and any existing quote or order reference in your message.</p><p>For a business enquiry, include quantities, locations and preferred timing.</p></aside></section></Layout>
